  "quest.5630AA44FEAF5025.quest_desc": [
    "Yeta Wrench — a item from the Ender IO mod.",
    "",
    "Ender IO turns your skyblock into a cable-strewn factory. Conduits, capacitors, and machines love a flat island with room to expand.",
    "",
    "How to make it:",
    "• Craft it in a shaped pattern — open JEI and search the item for the exact grid layout.",
    "",
    "Skyblock tip: your random center block may eventually roll the parts — stash duplicates in storage until you have the full recipe.",
  ],
  "quest.3429F61A8BFF4316.quest_subtitle": "Craft or obtain Redstone Toggle Filter",
  "task.56F02905CB234674.title": "Obtain Electromagnet",
  "quest.31E0A684CA45755C.quest_subtitle": "Craft or obtain Aversion Obelisk",
  "quest.518552CB092F4771.quest_desc": [
    "&eGrains of Infinity&r are Ender IO's starter spark — the tiny, smug powder that every alloy, capacitor, and conduit recipe keeps asking for.",
    "",
    "This is the entry quest for the whole Ender IO chapter. Get a few grains and the rest of the tab stops looking like abstract modern art.",
    "",
    "How to get it (this pack):",
    "• Light a &efire&r on a solid block and leave it alone for a bit — fires older than about &f13 seconds&r (260 ticks) can spit out Grains of Infinity.",
    "• Listen for the little ping (sound is on in pack config). Scoop the grains before they despawn or fall into the void.",
    "• Also check &eJEI&r for &fenderio:grains_of_infinity&r if alternate recipes exist on this NeoForge build.",
    "",
    "Once you have it, JEI lights up alloy lines (conductive, energetic, vibrant…), binder composites, and the first machines that turn your island into a cable jungle.",
    "",
    "&aCompleting this quest unlocks Ender IO blocks in the random one-block pool for your team.&r",
  ],
